  "tamil": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "kind": "stage-direction",
        "text": "(நாராயணப் பிள்ளையும், கருப்பனும் கோவிலுக்குச் சென்று வரும் வழியில்)"
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பிச்சை",
        "text": "பிச்சை : ஐயா! அந்த தேங்காய் முடியிலாவது ஒண்ணு கொடுங்கையா! (கருப்பன் கொடுத்தல்)"
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "நாரா",
        "text": "நாரா : ஏண்டா திமிர் பிடிச்ச பயலே! தேங்காயை ஏண்டா கொடுத்தே?"
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருப்",
        "text": "கருப் : கோயிலிலே பிரசங்கத்திலே சொன்னுங்களே தர்மம் தலைகாக்கும்னு."
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "நாரா",
        "text": "நாரா : கோயிலிலே உனக்கும் எனக்குமா சொன்னுன்? பணம்டா! கொண்டா இங்கே (திருப்பி கேட்கிறார்)"
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பிச்",
        "text": "பிச் : ஏழைங்க எஜமான்!"
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "நாரா",
        "text": "நாரா : ஏழை...ஏழவு (அடித்தல்) ஏ—நாயே! ஒனக்குப் பிரசாதம் கேக்குதா? (இந்நேரம் குணசேகரன் வருகிறான்)"
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "நாரா",
        "text": "நாரா : யாரடா நீ?"
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குண",
        "text": "குண : உங்களை எங்கேயோ பாத்தாப்புல இருக்குதுல்லே"
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "நாரா",
        "text": "நாரா : பார்த்திருப்பே பார்த்திருப்பே."
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குண",
        "text": "குண : நீங்க...நீங்க..."
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "நாரா",
        "text": "நாரா : ஜெனரல் மெர்ச்சண்ட் நாராயணப் பிள்ளை"
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குண",
        "text": "குண : நானு சேர்மையா..."
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "நாரா",
        "text": "நாரா : வேலைக்காரனு?"
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குண",
        "text": "குண : உங்களை..."
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "நாரா",
        "text": "நாரா : சேர்மன் பார்க்கணும்ன்றா?"
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குண",
        "text": "குண : ஆமா! ஆமா! அவருகூட உங்ககிட்டே"
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "நாரா",
        "text": "நாரா : சர்க்கரை வேணும்ன்றா? அவருக்கு மூட்டை மூட்டையால்ல வேணும், சாயந்திரமாக நம்ம வீட்டு பக்கமா வா இரகசியமாக தர்றேன்."
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குண",
        "text": "குண : ப்ளாக்கிலே தர்றீங்களா?"
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "நாரா",
        "text": "நாரா : அட நீ என்னப்பா?"
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குண",
        "text": "குண : அப்போ...சாயந்திரமா வரட்டுங்களா? ப்ளாக்கிலே தர்றீங்களா?"
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "நாரா",
        "text": "நாரா : வா...வா."
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குண",
        "text": "குண : அப்போ; இப்போ நான் போகட்டுங்களா?"
      },
      {
        "kind": "stage-direction",
        "text": "(நாராயண பிள்ளையை அடிக்கிறான்)"
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "நாரா",
        "text": "நாரா : என்னடாப்பா இது?"
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குண",
        "text": "குண : இது அடிடாப்பா! ஏ நாயே உனக்குத் தேங்கா கேக்குதோ? ஏழைகளுக்குப் பிரசாதம் கேக்குதா? கொண்டாடா இங்கே?"
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "நாரா",
        "text": "நாரா : பராசக்தி உன்னை ஒட்டப்பசங்க இன்னிக்கு அடிக்கிற அளவுக்கு வந்துட்டானுங்க."
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குண",
        "text": "குண : ஓடப்பராயிருக்கும் ஏழையப்பர் உதையப்பராகி விட்டால் ஒரு நொடிக்குள் ஓடப்பர் உயரப்பர் எல்லாம் மாறி ஒப்பப்பராகிவிடுவார் உணரப்பா நீ! ப்ளாக்கிலே தர்றீங்களா? இந்தா ப்ளாக்கிலே ஒண்ணு வாங்கிக்கோ... (நாராயணரைக் குணசேகரன் காலால் உதைத்துக் கீழே தள்ளுகிறான்)"
      }
    ]
  },
  "english": {
    "units": [
      {
        "id": "parasakthi-en-s030-u001",
        "kind": "stage-direction",
        "speakerLabel": null,
        "text": "(Narayana Pillai and Karuppan are on their way back from the temple.)",
        "lines": null,
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null
      },
      {
        "id": "parasakthi-en-s030-u002",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பிச்சை",
        "text": "Sir! At least give me one of those pieces of coconut! (Karuppan gives one.)",
        "lines": null,
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null
      },
      {
        "id": "parasakthi-en-s030-u003",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "நாரா",
        "text": "Hey, you arrogant fellow! Why did you give away the coconut?",
        "lines": null,
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null
      },
      {
        "id": "parasakthi-en-s030-u004",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருப்",
        "text": "At the temple sermon they said, 'Charity protects one's head.'",
        "lines": null,
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null
      },
      {
        "id": "parasakthi-en-s030-u005",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "நாரா",
        "text": "Did they say that at the temple for you and me? That's money, man! Give it here. (He asks for it back.)",
        "lines": null,
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null
      },
      {
        "id": "parasakthi-en-s030-u006",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பிச்",
        "text": "We're poor, master!",
        "lines": null,
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null
      },
      {
        "id": "parasakthi-en-s030-u007",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "நாரா",
        "text": "Poor... `ezhavu`! (He strikes him.) Hey—dog! You want prasad? (At this moment Gunasekaran arrives.)",
        "lines": null,
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null
      },
      {
        "id": "parasakthi-en-s030-u008",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "நாரா",
        "text": "Who are you?",
        "lines": null,
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null
      },
      {
        "id": "parasakthi-en-s030-u009",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குண",
        "text": "Feels like I've seen you somewhere.",
        "lines": null,
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null
      },
      {
        "id": "parasakthi-en-s030-u010",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "நாரா",
        "text": "You would have, you would have.",
        "lines": null,
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null
      },
      {
        "id": "parasakthi-en-s030-u011",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குண",
        "text": "You... you...",
        "lines": null,
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null
      },
      {
        "id": "parasakthi-en-s030-u012",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "நாரா",
        "text": "General Merchant Narayana Pillai.",
        "lines": null,
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null
      },
      {
        "id": "parasakthi-en-s030-u013",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குண",
        "text": "I... `sermaiya`...",
        "lines": null,
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null
      },
      {
        "id": "parasakthi-en-s030-u014",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "நாரா",
        "text": "A servant?",
        "lines": null,
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null
      },
      {
        "id": "parasakthi-en-s030-u015",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குண",
        "text": "You...",
        "lines": null,
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null
      },
      {
        "id": "parasakthi-en-s030-u016",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "நாரா",
        "text": "The chairman wants to see me?",
        "lines": null,
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null
      },
      {
        "id": "parasakthi-en-s030-u017",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குண",
        "text": "Yes! Yes! He too, from you...",
        "lines": null,
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null
      },
      {
        "id": "parasakthi-en-s030-u018",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "நாரா",
        "text": "Wants sugar? He needs it by the sackful, doesn't he? Come by our house in the evening; I'll give it secretly.",
        "lines": null,
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null
      },
      {
        "id": "parasakthi-en-s030-u019",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குண",
        "text": "You'll give it in black?",
        "lines": null,
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null
      },
      {
        "id": "parasakthi-en-s030-u020",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "நாரா",
        "text": "Hey, what are you?",
        "lines": null,
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null
      },
      {
        "id": "parasakthi-en-s030-u021",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குண",
        "text": "Then... shall I come in the evening? You'll give it in black?",
        "lines": null,
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null
      },
      {
        "id": "parasakthi-en-s030-u022",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "நாரா",
        "text": "Come... come.",
        "lines": null,
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null
      },
      {
        "id": "parasakthi-en-s030-u023",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குண",
        "text": "Then... may I go now?",
        "lines": null,
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null
      },
      {
        "id": "parasakthi-en-s030-u024",
        "kind": "stage-direction",
        "speakerLabel": null,
        "text": "(Gunasekaran strikes Narayana Pillai.)",
        "lines": null,
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null
      },
      {
        "id": "parasakthi-en-s030-u025",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "நாரா",
        "text": "What is this, man?",
        "lines": null,
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null
      },
      {
        "id": "parasakthi-en-s030-u026",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குண",
        "text": "This is a beating, man! Hey dog, you want coconut? You want prasad for the poor? Give it here!",
        "lines": null,
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null
      },
      {
        "id": "parasakthi-en-s030-u027",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "நாரா",
        "text": "Parasakthi! These `ottappa` fellows have come to the point of beating you today.",
        "lines": null,
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null
      },
      {
        "id": "parasakthi-en-s030-u028",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குண",
        "text": "If the poor, who have been the ones running, become the ones who kick, then in a moment those who run and those who stand high will all change and become equals—understand that! You'll give it in black? Here, take one in black... (Gunasekaran kicks Narayana Pillai and knocks him down.)",
        "lines": null,
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null
      }
    ]
  },
